      "y": 390,
      "w": 380,
      "fields": {
        "text": "Turn the supplied rough pencil sketch into a clean, fully colored flat icon. Preserve every depicted object, its relative size, pose and position, the overall composition and the white background. Use a small cheerful palette of teal, coral red, warm cream, golden yellow and blue; fill every major closed region with solid color. Use a consistent dark navy outline and clearly closed shapes. Remove pencil wobble and construction marks. Keep the result recognizable as this exact drawing. No monochrome tracing, no texture, no gradients, no text and no added objects."
      }
